Overview:

.

CelebrateSpot

CelebrateSpot is your ultimate online destination for discovering the perfect party hall for
your next memorable event. Whether you're planning a wedding, birthday bash, corporate
gathering, or any special occasion, CelebrateSpot has the ideal venue to make your
celebration truly unforgettable.

Users of the System:
Admin
Roles:
· Admin registration and login.
. Add party hall, edit party hall details, delete party hall details and view all party halls.
· Admin can view bookings and change the status of booking.
. Admin can view reviews given by the customer.

Customer
Roles:
. Customer registration and login.
Customers can view all party halls.
. Add booking and delete booking can also be done.
. Customer can add and view reviews.
Modules of the Application:
Admin:
Register
Login
Dashboard
. Add party hall details.
View party hall details (Edit and delete)
View booking details (Edit booking status)
. View all reviews

Customer:
Register
Login
. Dashboard
. View party hall details (Add booking)
· View booking (Delete)
. Add review and view reviews

Technology Stack

Front End

Back End

Angular 10+, HTML, CSS

